#: tuxbox/gui/profile_settings_dialog.py:180
msgid ""
"Time window for detecting double-press actions.\n"
"Shorter = tighter timing, less accidental triggers.\n"
"Longer = more forgiving, easier to hit."
msgstr ""
"Délai de détection des doubles appuis.\n"
"Plus court = plus exigeant, moins de déclenchements accidentels.\n"
"Plus long = plus tolérant, plus facile à réussir."

